OL,3,GNEWSAConsumers face another sharp rise
OL,4,Ain energy prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Trump's comments on Ireland's
OL,7,Fpossible constitutional future grabbed
OL,8,Fthe headlines at the weekend.
OL,10,FBut it is his war on Iran which is
OL,11,Fhaving a practical impact on people
OL,12,Facross the island as energy prices
OL,13,Fclimb again.
OL,15,FA barrel of oil, on the widely used
OL,16,FBrent crude measurement, has started
OL,17,Fthis week at $108.
