OL,3,GNEWSAConsumers face another sharp rise
OL,4,Ain energy prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat is a four-month high and close to
OL,7,Fthe level reached in the early stage of
OL,8,Fthe conflict, when Iran closed the
OL,9,FStrait of Hormuz and reduced the amount
OL,10,Fof oil reaching world markets.
